actions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T01:15:18-07:00","id":1136113,"title":"","content":"Shard Realm of Prime -<br /> Conjure or create a small beautiful and symbolic item. As you spend time in and journey across the Shard Realm of Prime, find novel and new justifications as to why the item does not need to be changed or replaced to reflect your growing experience and comprehension of Prime - it already is perfect, this fact just needs to be properly known.<br /> Is the item already perfect before the justifications for it's perfection are thought up? Do those justifications exist before they are thought and/or spoken? If they do exist before, then in what form, and why?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 09-01-2017, 04:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}